{"id":"d7a2af5c9d764548","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-admissible-set.md","title":"Admissible Set","display":"df-zfc-admissible-set — Admissible Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-admissible-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-admissible-set"],"display":"df-zfc-admissible-set — Admissible Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-admissible-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-admissible-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-admissible-set — Admissible Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4cbfb5925afe7f86\" href=\"?note=4cbfb5925afe7f86\" title=\"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set\">58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\)</span> is the registered predicate using an explicit set-coded membership structure and the model relation (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4cbfb5925afe7f86\" href=\"?note=4cbfb5925afe7f86\" title=\"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set\">58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\)</span> (abbreviation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical predicate supplies the membership-structure code required by the registered satisfaction relation; the bare pair <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A,\\in\\cap A^2\\rangle\">\\(\\langle A,\\in\\cap A^2\\rangle\\)</span> was not that structure code.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set","status":"resolved","id":"4cbfb5925afe7f86","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set","status":"resolved","id":"4cbfb5925afe7f86","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)$ is the registered predicate using an explicit set-coded membership structure and the model relation (see [[58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AdmissibleSet}_S(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle A,\\in\\cap A^2\\rangle","display":false}],"bytes":931,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1409","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-admissible-set.md|58-df-zfc-admissible-set]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["4cbfb5925afe7f86"]}